description	"Clone Trooper (Phase I)

Brief Overview: 
A Phase I Clone Trooper built for sustained frontline combat. Slow and dangerous. Equipped with a DC-15LE Heavy Repeater.

^2Default Weaponry:
- Melee
- DC-15LE Heavy Repeater 
-- Based on T21
-- 10% faster ROF 
-- 10% slower velocity
-- 15% less damage

^8Default Attributes:
- Reinforcement (4)
- Stamina 1
- Beskar 2
- Assemble 3 (Respawn at rally point)

^3Default Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"
